# The agni-samples release this tree is pinned to.
#
# https://github.com/panyam/agni-samples holds the real, publicly-licensed boards the tests and the
# docsite tutorial read. They are not committed here because they are not ours: each carries its own
# licence (Apache-2.0, CERN-OHL-P), and this repo stays uniformly Apache-2.0.
#
# hack/fetch_samples.sh reads this file, downloads each named artifact from the release, verifies it
# against the checksum below, and extracts it into tools/samples/ (gitignored). Changing anything in
# this file re-fetches, because the stamp is a hash of the file itself.
#
# TO BUMP: change VERSION, replace each checksum with the ones from the release's SHA256SUMS, and
# run `make samples`. A checksum that does not match is a hard failure, never a warning, because a
# fixture that silently fails to arrive turns every test that reads it into a test that proves
# nothing.
VERSION v0.1.15
